# XFCE panel plugins for pipnode.
#
# Unlike plugins/ (which holds pipnode *node* plugins loaded by the
# editor), this tree holds desktop-integration applets that live in the
# XFCE panel.  Each applet is its own subdirectory; add new ones here.
#
# This whole subtree is only recursed into when libxfce4panel-2.0 is
# present at configure time (see BUILD_PANEL_PLUGINS in the top-level
# Makefile.am / configure.ac).
SUBDIRS = pipnode-xfce-applet
